{
  "_header": [
    "Shared git guard cases. Byte-identical in bower-labs/website, bower-internal-apps, docs and",
    "bower-mobile-app: copy this file whole, never edit it in one repo. A repo's intentional",
    "differences go in .claude/hooks/guard-git.cases.local.json (overrides + local cases).",
    "Source: bower-labs/website 1e1548d785196683cca8ba821d25bbcc44401f3e (.claude/hooks/test-guard-git.py, PR #40).",
    "Each case runs in a scratch repo holding scratch_files, on branch claude/test ('branch') or main ('main').",
    "{branch_repo} and {main_repo} are replaced by those repos' paths. expect: block = exit 2, allow = exit 0.",
    "guard_sha256 pins .claude/hooks/guard-git.py: change the guard and this file together, in every repo.",
    "Copying between repos is by hand; the pins make a partial or local edit fail CI, nothing more."
  ],
  "source": "bower-labs/website@1e1548d785196683cca8ba821d25bbcc44401f3e",
  "guard_sha256": "cb00803a54b87e0269f4e75361a2315ff2539ada09d06b83020635d114b17726",
